    slug: "how-to-authenticate-vintage-band-tee",
    title: "How to authenticate a vintage band tee: tags, prints, and tells",
    excerpt: "Learn how to authenticate a vintage band tee using tag brands, print technique, fabric weight, and copyright tells. A practical guide to original concert tees.",
